    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "d925fe0a68f6587d5734308b"
      },
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Next, Commander? Well, our second task is to join Wave 2 of Operation Rat. Wave 1 has been a total success. The Confederation is now split in two, several of its best BattleMech regiments are no more, and we are about to make the situation that much more dire for Maximilian Liao. \n\nWe are now to make all possible speed for [[DM.SystemDefs[starsystemdef_Ningpo], Ningpo]]. There'll be little time for rest and recovery, as we will be straight into battle again when we arrive. I'll brief you properly once we are in system, but in the meantime, I expect you to get moving alongside the transports of the Third Guards.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "That we can do, Marshal, I'll have Sumire fire up the Argo ASAP and have us underway.",
